## Why This Is Asked
Assesses practical, low-latency PCA design for mobile analytics with drift and missing data.

## Key Concepts
- Fixed-basis on-device projection
- Global vs per-user PCA
- Latency budgeting via matrix multiply
- Interpreting loadings for cohorts

## Code Example
```javascript
// Apply fixed PCA projection on-device
const mean = [/* 40 elements */];
const components = [
  [/* 40 numbers */],
  [/* ... */],
  [/* 5 rows */]
];
function project(x){
  const z = x.map((v,i)=> v - mean[i]);
  return components.map(row => row.reduce((acc, w, i)=> acc + w * z[i], 0));
}
```

